\title{popcorn: Population-Scale Personalized Coexpression Network Estimation}
\description{
Estimates reliable, donor-specific gene co-expression correlations from population-scale single-cell RNA-seq data. POPCORN first fits a covariate-adjusted marginal model to correct technical and compositional noise within each donor's own cells, then applies a random-effects variance decomposition that separates genuine between-donor heterogeneity from sampling noise at each gene pair, adaptively shrinking noisy donor-level estimates toward the global correlation using information borrowed jointly across donors.
}
